# Production build configuration.
#
# Loaded by Vite ONLY for mode=production — i.e. `npm run build`. The dev server
# (mode=development) and Vitest (mode=test) do not read this file, which is deliberate:
#
#   - `npm run dev`   -> VITE_API_BASE_URL unset -> the in-process test double, as before.
#   - `npm test`      -> VITE_API_BASE_URL unset -> the whole suite keeps running offline.
#   - `npm run build` -> the deployed mock API over HTTPS, and the double (plus the 105
#                        normalized Decision Objects it imports) is dropped from the bundle.
#
# This is the ONLY place the deployed URL appears. No component, service or business-logic
# module names it — services/decisionApi.js reads it through `import.meta.env` and nothing else
# in the application knows a URL exists.
#
# To point a local dev server at the deployed API instead of the double:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://realify-mock-api.onrender.com npm run dev
#
# To build against a locally running mock-server/ instead:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3001 npm run build

VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://realify-mock-api.onrender.com
